<title>JAPAN: India tenders for one mln brls Nov crude - traders.</title>
<headline>India tenders for one mln brls Nov crude - traders.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-09-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Indian Oil Corp (IOC) has tendered to buy one million barrels of a wide variety of crude oils for November, traders said on Friday.</p>
<p>The tender closes on September 26 at 9 a.m. (0330 GMT) and offers should be valid until September 27 at 10 p.m. (1630 GMT), they said.</p>
<p>The tender is for a wide range of crude oil, including the Middle East, Asian regional grades, North Sea and West African, crudes, traders said.</p>
